    {
      "id": "story_navigation",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "steps": [
          {
            "step": 0,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=0&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nDISCOVER · REHEARSAL\nOne healthy VM does not qualify a fleet\n×\nOne healthy VM does not qualify a fleet\nSCALE INTRODUCES PLACEMENT, CONCURRENCY, MIGRATION, DISRUPTION, CONTINUITY, AND CONTAINMENT DEPENDENCIES.\n01 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 1,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=1&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nBASELINE\nEvery claim needs an owner and an evidence path\n\nReveal the causal boundary before showing a result.\n\n1\nFleet identity\n2\nPlacement\n3\nEnvelope\n4\nAuthority\nAUDIENCE QUESTION\nWhat exactly is under qualification?\nReveal technical boundary\nactive request and evidence path\ndeployment or trust boundary\noptional integration\nAUTHORITY\nHuman reviewer\nsets the envelope and owns promotion\nNAMESPACED QUALIFICATION BOUNDARY\nread-only evidence evaluation; no cluster mutation or promotion authority\ngenerate load\n→\nKUBEVIRT\nVM inference fleet\ndistinct VirtualMachine and VMI identities\ninfer\n→\nSERVICE\nInference service\nexecution identity and returned request evidence\ncorrelate\n→\nEVIDENCE\nCorrelated telemetry\nrequest, VM, migration, disruption, CPU, and continuity\nqualify\n→\nPOLICY\nDeterministic policy\nALLOW_REVIEW · REFUSE · ABSTAIN\nPOST /api/v1/qualifications\nchange placement\n→\nEVENT\nMigration trial\nexternally executed and directly observed\nstress boundary\n→\nEVENT\nDisruption trial\nbou"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=2&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nMIGRATE\nA migration event is not a qualification result\nThe VMI moved\n→\nPlacement + inference + state + correlation remained continuous\n\nThe changed condition must survive the same declared envelope.\n\n03 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=3&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\n1\nEnvelope satisfied\n2\nCapacity boundary crossed\n3\nEvidence chain breaks\nGOVERNED REHEARSAL\nStart with one declared qualification envelope\nPreserve the exact digest, observed result, source state, and human authority.\nINPUT\nFleet qualification request\nOne typed contract binds fleet identity, trial measurements, placement, continuity, containment, and correlated evidence.\nInspect technical topology\nRun qualification conditions\nAUTHORITY\nPromotion remains human-owned\n\nThe adapter evaluates supplied evidence. It never migrates, disrupts, certifies, or promotes a workload.\n\nALLOW_REVIEW permits inspection; it never authorizes certification or promotion.\n04 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "condition_result": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\n1\nEnvelope satisfied\n2\nCapacity boundary crossed\n3\nEvidence chain breaks\nCONDITION 1 OF 3\nEnvelope satisfied\nAll three trials preserve containment, correlation, and state continuity.\nREHEARSAL\nDECISION\nALLOW_REVIEW\nREASON\nQualification Envelope Satisfied\nSOURCE\nREHEARSAL\n\nLive endpoint returned HTTP 405 Showing clearly labeled fallback evidence.\n\nInspect technical topology\nNext qualification condition →\nAUTHORITY\nPromotion remains human-owned\n\nThe adapter evaluates supplied evidence. It never migrates, disrupts, certifies, or promotes a workload.\n\nALLOW_REVIEW permits inspection; it never authorizes certification or promotion.\n04 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=4&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nCORRELATE\nContinuity is a chain, not a green dashboard\n01\nIdentity\nVM → node → CPU → request\nThe workload and placement records bind to the same request.\n02\nState\nbefore → change → after\nMigration and restart preserve an inspectable ledger.\n03\nContainment\nfailure stays bounded\nA disruption cannot leak across the declared fleet boundary.\n05 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 5,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=5&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nQUALIFY\nPolicy turns evidence into a bounded recommendation\nCOMPLETE + INSIDE ENVELOPE\nALLOW_REVIEW\n\nEligible for human promotion review only\n\nKNOWN BOUNDARY BREACH\nREFUSE\n\nSLO, capacity, or containment failed\n\nEVIDENCE INCOMPLETE\nABSTAIN\n\nCorrelation or state continuity is missing\n\n06 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 6,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=6&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nHANDOFF\nA candidate is immutable before it becomes certifiable\nREHEARSAL\n1 proof condition completed\nDECISION\nALLOW_REVIEW\nREASON\nQualification Envelope Satisfied\nSOURCE\nREHEARSAL\nDISCOVER → BASELINE → MIGRATE → DISRUPT → CORRELATE → QUALIFY → HANDOFF remains durable.\nLaunchpad still owns trusted rendering, live seats, capacity graduation, certification, and promotion.\nContinue in the separate 75–90 minute Showroom lab →\n07 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 7,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-501-6b1cf2ac/proxy/tool/story/?act=6&scene=0&finale=1",
